  "source": "Median wallDurationMs of each shared file in the checks-baseline and checks-browser lanes over five green main CI runs (c08598210 and the four before it, from #2736 on; provisioning-400 from b6bda8ee5 and the four before it; console-agents-2 and kubernetes-real-kubectl from 7e2000970 and the four before it; console-agent-logs from bef197b8a and the four before it, less the 4.1 s that #2841 took off its UTC-offset test, 10.96 s median there and 6.88 s on #2841's CI; console-agents-list-return from 5cc598483 and the four before it), rounded to 100 ms, from the ci-results-<lane> artifacts. Every checks-browser and checks-browser-2 row is the median over 3139f1309 and the seven green main runs before it (10-19), except console-button-hierarchy (plus the medians of the tests it took from console-badges and console-focus-ring), console-agent-deploy-again and console-focus-ring (less the medians of the tests they gave it); console-drafts-kept (grown by #2900) and console-status-block (new in #2902) are medians of their CI runs on dff2c59c4 and the #2900 and #2902 branches. console-form-fields (new in #2907) is the median of its green runs on e4f63d4a6 and 5f9db3f9d (main) and on 006ad9e84, 925d082e2 and 8c6506efd (the #2907 and #2908 branches). Refresh rows when a lane's longest files change (a PR that edits this table runs full CI); a file without a row starts first. Since #2903 the runners have been slower (from about 08:45Z on 10-19), so the rows changed after that are on the earlier scale: each main run's time for a file is divided by that run lane's slowdown factor (the median, over the lane's files that no PR changed since #2903, of their time over their row), and the row is the median of those over the main runs since the file last changed (console-button-hierarchy 22 runs, console-drafts-kept 24, console-form-fields 18, console-form-fields-2 12, console-status-block 8, console-agents-list-return 7, console-namespace-not-ready 6). The files the consolidation PR changed are then scaled by their local before/after ratio at 2 CPUs (median of 5 paired runs: console-status-block 0.687, console-agents-list-return 0.847, console-form-fields 0.942, console-form-fields-2 0.846; console-namespace-not-ready unchanged). console-agent-name-runs is its one run since #2943, unscaled. console-status-block (unchanged since #2947, whose 0.687 local ratio did not hold on CI) and console-namespace-recheck (new in #2944, changed by #2952) are the same slowdown-normalised median over the main runs since they last changed, with the factor taken against these rows: 8 runs from 22283f690 to d331d24fd, and 3 from 7144acebd to d331d24fd. dev-up was split into dev-up-compose (Compose stack) and dev-up (Kubernetes Compute): its slowdown-normalised median over the 15 green main runs from 61ec42252 to d331d24fd (55.1 s, factor taken against these rows) is scaled by each half's share of its 79.3 s of summed per-test CI medians: 44.5 s for dev-up-compose, and for dev-up 34.8 s plus 2.2 s for building its own CLI. console-shell (last changed by #2996), console-page-header (new in #2977) and console-focus-ring (changed by #2977), credential-source-api and agent-create-validate-api are the same slowdown-normalised median over the green main runs whose head has the file's last change, from the flake-sweep-1020 window (10-19 18:00Z to 10-20 04:18Z, plus #3000), with each run lane's factor taken against these rows over its files other than these six: 2, 15, 15, 21 and 21 runs. console-namespace-create (new in #2961, grown by #3002) is the same median over 81c57a76c (main) and #3002's two branch runs. Every shared file in the PostgreSQL Application, PostgreSQL Platform, Checks and Conformance 1 and 2, and Images and Packaging lanes (rows added for the ones that had none) is the median over e45c5a9e1 and the fourteen green main runs before it (10-24), which replaces the earlier history above for those lanes' rows. console-agent-detail (59.8 s before its 10-25 permission-test lean-out) is scaled by 0.821, the median ratio of 5 paired local runs at 2 CPUs after/before. console-agents-2 (76.8 s), console-create-agent-provisioning-400 (59.7 s) and console-agents (74.0 s), before their 10-25 provisioning polls moved to the page clock, are scaled by 0.668, 0.885 and 0.979, the median ratios of 3 paired local runs at 2 CPUs after/before. Every checks-browser and checks-browser-2 row (rows added for the ones that had none) is the median over the 15 green main runs from 01e1a7fab to fff5bfcfc (10-25 21:56Z to 10-26 01:30Z, ci-rerank-1026), which replaces the earlier history above for those lanes' rows.",
